# Triangle Arithmetic – 4x faster base-4 borrow propagation with NEON

```c
#include <triangle.h>

// Process 1 million triangles in 35ms on M2
Triangle tri[1000000];
uint64_t borrows[1000000];
triangle_borrow_batch(tri, 1000000, borrows);

## Build

```bash
git clone https://github.com/devjordanmorris-hash/Compute-over-JLO
cd Compute-over-JLO
make          # builds both scalar and NEON
make test     # runs correctness tests
make bench    # shows 4x speedup on M1/M2/M3
